msgstr "FAQ — questions fréquentes sur l'indemnisation indicative"

msgid ""
"Answers to common questions about indicative compensation estimates: whether "
"they are binding, which cases are calculable, what documents are needed, and "
"how your personal data is handled."
msgstr "Réponses aux questions fréquentes sur les estimations indicatives d'indemnisation : leur caractère contraignant ou non, les cas calculables, les documents nécessaires et le traitement de vos données personnelles."

msgid "Frequent questions"
msgstr "Questions fréquentes"

msgid "Questions about indicative compensation"
msgstr "Questions sur l'indemnisation indicative"

msgid ""
"Prudent answers, with no promises and no invented figures. For anything "
"specific to your case, ask the Studio for a free preliminary assessment."
msgstr "Des réponses prudentes, sans promesses ni chiffres inventés. Pour tout ce qui est propre à votre dossier, demandez au Cabinet une évaluation initiale gratuite."

msgid "Still have a question?"
msgstr "Vous avez encore une question ?"

msgid ""
"A lawyer reads your request and replies. The preliminary assessment is free "
